<Defs>

<!--
Royal saps are saps that have very powerful effects - generally like that of a metasap - but are extremely rare.
These saps often change the weapon mechanics entirely, or entirely eliminate the lifespan mechanic.

The royal saps are
  -Roguesap
  -Eldersap
  -Chronosap
  -Archsap
-->

  <!--=====Archsap=====-->

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>ET_Archsap</defName>
    <label>Archsap</label>
    <description>A jar of archsap, originating from sources unknown. People and colonies skilled with Ecotech can use this to replace the mundane sap of certain Terraweapons, caused the weapon to gain special traits that will persist throughout it's lifetime.
\nArchsap is considered a 'royal' sap, which is a sap so concentrated, it's toxic to weapons not fully grown. Therefore, it MUST be infused into an baseline matured weapon. These are weapons that have only been subjected to glowsap in a terravat.
Careful care, usage, and weapon selection is highly advised, due to it's extreme rarity, value, and effect of making it's host weapon semi-immortal.
\n\nNew traits:
Infinite lifespan
Flammability lowered by 50%
Weapon HP increased by by 50%</description>
    <tickerType>Normal</tickerType>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Resource/Archsap</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.8</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <stackLimit>3</stackLimit>
    <healthAffectsPrice>false</healthAffectsPrice>
    <intricate>true</intricate>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>100</MaxHitPoints>
      <MarketValue>804</MarketValue>
      <Mass>0.05</Mass>
      <Flammability>1</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>0.25</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>RoyalSapsAll</li>
    </thingCategories>
  </ThingDef>

